# Images aicom-disk-cleanup never removes, whatever their age or tag: one shell glob per line, matched against
# the repository (histor-node) or the full reference (histor-node:22). install.sh adds these lines to
# /etc/aicom-disk-cleanup.keep and keeps the host's own; add an image here when a program starts it with
# `docker run` and it carries no org.modelmarket.keep label.
#
# HISTOR package sandbox (histor/sandbox/install.sh; histor_observe.IMAGES and RUNTIMES): started per run.
histor-node
histor-python

# Malware-feed accuracy study, stage 3 scanners on the sandbox host (research/malware-feed-accuracy/keep):
# started per run with `docker run`; mfa-study-keep also holds and reloads them.
mfa-py-scanners
mfa-ossgadget
mfa-packj
mfa-malcontent
cgr.dev/chainguard/malcontent
